    <title>24.对话蚂蚁集团副总裁伟鹤：做AI医疗要成为医生的战友，而不是对手</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689b0cd9032793b18a045d49</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689b0cd9032793b18a045d49</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Aug 2025 09:51:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>受采嘉宾：伟鹤</span></p><span></span><p><span>·蚂蚁集团副总裁</span></p><span></span><p><span>·数字医疗健康事业部总经理</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持人：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/119801456?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/119801456?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>老蒋巨靠谱</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期受邀AI Deep Talk专访，在WAIC现场进行录制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">0:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">1:54</a> 开场与嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">1:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">5:16</a> 蚂蚁集团迈向科技的三个十年计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">5:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> AI技术在医疗健康服务中的应用与发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 为何独立推出医疗APP而非支付宝内设入口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 当前模型的幻觉问题与解决方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 详细解释医疗领域的模型评测标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">19:24</a> 与医院合作的案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> 与医生合作的案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 打造医疗AI智能体的周期与投入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 蚂蚁做AI医疗的最终愿景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 降低误诊率的方法：优化AI诊疗流程的设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 如何解决AI在长期健康管理中的数据记忆与安全问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">34:48</a> AI在医疗行业的未来应用及影响</span></p>]]></description>
