  <item>
    <title>23.对谈Judy，情绪消费时代：性价比不是唯一，&quot;爽&quot;才是王道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686bce9260f8f77d404e8189</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686bce9260f8f77d404e8189</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 14:19:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：Judy</span></p><span></span><p><span>·前湖畔/阿里企业培训专家</span></p><span></span><p><span>·95后连续创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>·百万粉商业媒体人</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632d38ac000000002303bf0d?xsec_token=YBzwYmJnPL4SXKIoBq-sE6v0b4NQPYbWy39I1IAW8-mms=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632d38ac000000002303bf0d&amp;apptime=1751888245&amp;&amp;share_id=468bd6ed0df344d3bae21277317dc084" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632d38ac000000002303bf0d?xsec_token=YBzwYmJnPL4SXKIoBq-sE6v0b4NQPYbWy39I1IAW8-mms=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632d38ac000000002303bf0d&amp;apptime=1751888245&amp;&amp;share_id=468bd6ed0df344d3bae21277317dc084"><span>是Judy呀</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> &nbsp;2025消费市场数据回暖，体感呈现K型背离 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> &nbsp;国产品牌升级核心转向情绪价值 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> &nbsp;Z世代成消费主力，为当下体验买单 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> &nbsp;新消费观追求在场感与自我身份定义 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> &nbsp;旅游体验升级重在参与感与真实性质价比 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> &nbsp;制造业品牌化是必然出路，出海标杆引领 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> &nbsp;代工厂转型品牌面临与客户竞争困局 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a> &nbsp;国产科技品牌成功突破高端市场 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> &nbsp;细分市场国牌靠本土化与线上效率崛起 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> &nbsp;美妆国牌聚焦本土需求发力中低端 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">35:06</a> &nbsp;高端美妆市场仍由国际品牌主导 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a> &nbsp;制造业呈现鲜明地域分工特色 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> &nbsp;二代接班加速品牌化与新市场开拓 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> &nbsp;品牌化空间巨大但需克服成本与转型挑战 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3306">55:06</a> &nbsp;户外品牌年轻化，功能与社交属性并重 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3852">1:04:12</a> &nbsp;黄金消费转向悦己，高价网购接受度提升 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4191">1:09:51</a> &nbsp;国产宠物粮突破食品安全信任壁垒 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4672">1:17:52</a> &nbsp;制造业升级依赖溢价驱动行业标准 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4886">1:21:26</a> &nbsp;纯爱好消费兴起重构低责任社交 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5336">1:28:56</a> &nbsp;消费趋势分化：功能极致性价比，情绪高溢价 &nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6490181ca5b2b405c63a251f/lpQbJUDFdMvJcekvRm_KS1WRQl4I.m4a" length="183629556" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:35:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv4vmhAiJxsLunFd6woH0Y9CzxBZ.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>23</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
